663        data Mixture;
664        drop i;
665        do i=1 to 1000;
666        X1 = ranuni(1);
667        C1 = int(3*ranuni(1));
668        if C1=0 then Y=exp(5*(X1-0.3)**2)+rannor(1);
669        else if C1=1 then Y=log(X1*(1-X1))+rannor(1);
670        else Y=7*X1+rannor(1);
671        output;
672        end;
673        run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.MIXTURE has 1000 observations and 3 variables.

674        ods graphics on;
675        proc adaptivereg data=Mixture plots=fit;
676        class c1;
677        model y=c1 x1;
678        run;

NOTE: The PROCEDURE ADAPTIVEREG printed page 26.

